<title>USA: Gilbert Associates Q4 net shr loss.</title>
<headline>Gilbert Associates Q4 net shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>READING, Pa. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>		    1/3/97     12/29/95	1/3/97	12/29/95</p>
<p> Revenues   $55,403,000 $44,883,000 $190,066,000 $193,495,000</p>
<p>Net Income</p>
<p>From Contin.</p>
<p>  Operations  3,230,000   1,134,000    6,991,000    4,338,000</p>
<p>Income Per</p>
<p>Share/Contin.</p>
<p>  Operations	 0.51	  0.18	   1.11	   0.66</p>
<p>Net Income</p>
<p>  (Loss)    (6,080,000) (4,996,000)  (1,884,000)   16,950,000</p>
<p>Net Income</p>
<p>  (Loss)/Share   (0.96)	(0.79)	 (0.30)	   2.57</p>
<p> Avg shares   6,316,951   6,290,534    6,299,127    6,592,174</p>
<p>Full company name is Gilberts Associates Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Fourth quarter 1996 operating income excludes $10.3 million charge or $1.63 per share loss due to the write-off of SAFCO's in-process research and development and a $990,000 or $0.16 per share gain for the reversal of previously established reserves. Full year 1996 results also exclude $0.07 per share gain due to favorable lawsuit settlement.</p>
